# 🚀 MAANG DSA Interview Playbook (Master Notes)

## 🎯 Goal

* Crack MAANG / Product Company coding interviews.
* Learn **patterns**, not memorize solutions.
* Solve **150 high-quality problems** instead of 500 random ones.
* Think like an interviewer expects.

---

# 📋 Interview Rules (Follow for EVERY Problem)

* Read the problem completely before coding.
* Never jump directly to the optimal solution.
* Think aloud during the interview.
* Start with the brute-force solution.
* Explain **why** it works.
* Derive time and space complexity.
* Then optimize.
* Always dry-run your code.
* Consider edge cases before finishing.

