# 🧠 Memory Shortcut #1 — Module-wise Pattern Recognition

| Requirement / Clue                     | Pattern             | Typical Template                      |
| -------------------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------------------- |
| Need every element?                    | Traversal           | `for x in nums:`                      |
| Need index?                            | Enumerate           | `for i, x in enumerate(nums):`        |
| Need custom jumps?                     | Range Loop          | `for i in range(start, end, step):`   |
| Need to search a value?                | Linear Search       | `for x in nums:`                      |
| Need fast search in sorted data?       | Binary Search       | `while left <= right:`                |
| Need frequency/count?                  | Hash Map            | `freq = {}`                           |
| Need duplicate detection?              | Seen Set            | `seen = set()`                        |
| Need quick key → value lookup?         | Dictionary Mapping  | `mapping[key] = value`                |
| Need both ends?                        | Two Pointers        | `left, right = 0, len(nums)-1`        |
| Need continuous window?                | Sliding Window      | `left = 0` + expand/shrink `right`    |
| Need cumulative/range sums?            | Prefix Sum          | `prefix[i] = prefix[i-1] + nums[i]`   |
| Need modify elements in-place?         | In-place Update     | `nums[i] = value`                     |
| Need swap two elements?                | Swap Pattern        | `nums[i], nums[j] = nums[j], nums[i]` |
| Need reverse data?                     | Reverse Pattern     | `nums.reverse()` / `[::-1]`           |
| Need rotate array/string?              | Rotation Pattern    | `nums[:] = nums[-k:] + nums[:-k]`     |
| Need rearrange by condition?           | Partition           | `if condition:`                       |
| Need build a new filtered/output list? | Append Pattern      | `result.append(x)`                    |
| Need simulate step-by-step?            | Simulation          | `while condition:`                    |
| Need process rows & columns?           | Matrix Traversal    | `for r in range(rows):`               |
| Need manipulate characters?            | String Traversal    | `for ch in s:`                        |
| Need repeated smallest/largest?        | Heap                | `heapq.heappush()`                    |
| Need LIFO?                             | Stack               | `stack.append()` / `stack.pop()`      |
| Need FIFO?                             | Queue               | `deque()`                             |
| Need merge ranges?                     | Intervals           | `intervals.sort()`                    |
| Need connected nodes?                  | Graph DFS/BFS       | `dfs()` / `queue.append()`            |
| Need parent-child traversal?           | Tree DFS/BFS        | `dfs(root)`                           |
| Need all combinations?                 | Backtracking        | `def backtrack():`                    |
| Need repeated optimal subproblems?     | Dynamic Programming | `dp = []`                             |
| Need locally best choice?              | Greedy              | `sort()` + choose                     |

